{"id":"be2cebc2adfb421f","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-comb-thin-stationary-set.md","title":"ZFC Comb Thin Stationary Set","display":"df-zfc-comb-thin-stationary-set — ZFC Comb Thin Stationary Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb-thin-stationary-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb-thin-stationary-set"],"display":"df-zfc-comb-thin-stationary-set — ZFC Comb Thin Stationary Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb-thin-stationary-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb-thin-stationary-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb-thin-stationary-set — ZFC Comb Thin Stationary Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,S\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,S\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCombThinStationarySet}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCombThinStationarySet}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。 对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 和序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}thin\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCombThinStationarySet}_S(S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land S\\subseteq[\\kappa]^\\omega\\land\\forall F\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(F,[\\kappa]^{&lt;\\omega},\\kappa)\\to\\exists x\\in S\\;\\forall a\\in[x]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(F(a)\\in x)\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;|\\{x\\cap\\alpha:x\\in S\\}|&lt;\\kappa\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}thin\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCombThinStationarySet}_S(S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land S\\subseteq[\\kappa]^\\omega\\land\\forall F\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(F,[\\kappa]^{&lt;\\omega},\\kappa)\\to\\exists x\\in S\\;\\forall a\\in[x]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(F(a)\\in x)\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;|\\{x\\cap\\alpha:x\\in S\\}|&lt;\\kappa\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>驻集闭包条件中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 现为集合函数，thin 条件中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\">\\(\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\)</span> 展开为序数成员关系，并显式排除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa=\\omega\">\\(\\kappa=\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"reso